          <label class="form-check-label" for="mode_per_installment"><strong>All installments in one mandate</strong> (recommended) &mdash; every unpaid installment below goes to Collexia in a single mandate (one per split part) and is collected exactly on its schedule date.</label>
        </div>
        <div class="form-check">
          <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="mode" id="mode_legacy" value="legacy" <?= $mode === 'legacy' ? 'checked' : '' ?>>
          <label class="form-check-label" for="mode_legacy">Single recurring mandate, or split one installment into several parts</label>
        </div>
